Package: docker-restricted-egress
Version: 0.0.1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: docker-restricted-egress contributors <root@localhost>
Depends: bash (>= 5.0), iptables, systemd, util-linux, coreutils, docker-ce | docker.io
Description: Restrict IPv4 egress from a managed Docker bridge
 Provides a Docker bridge network with private-network egress rejection,
 fail-closed startup and reload, and systemd lifecycle integration.
 Intended for a local rootful Docker Engine using its iptables backend.
